  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textDisplay: {fileID: 775908002}
  sentences:
  - You've found me, adventurer!
  - I saw terrifying things here. And the most terrifyed thing is at the end of the
    Middle cave!
  - I have only power to create one platform that will help you reach the end of
    the Middle cave where you can face him.
  - If you already have not been at my brother, Pinkman, then you have to go him.
    He will help you create a second platform! Otherwise go direct to the Middle
    cave!
  - Here is the small platform. If you jump on it, it will teleport you at the start
    of Upper cave!
  - From there you can continue your journey! Good luck, adventurer!
  - 
  typingSpeed: 0.01
  activateDialog: {fileID: 1049466443}
  activatePortal: {fileID: 850187672}
